ROS 2 message and service types for Asterism (Asterism::ROS).

Each .rb file here was generated by Asterism's tools/asterism_msggen.rb
from the ROS 2 Jazzy definition it names (packages std_msgs,
geometry_msgs, sensor_msgs, builtin_interfaces, service_msgs,
example_interfaces). The definitions are licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt), and so are these files.
